[{"id":179161955,"discussion_id":"cb2eb28a019f44f9c001288834e4269ff798250c","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n该 PR 修复了 FlashAttention 推理算子在 TND 布局下，`CombineSplitKVRes` 中 `lseOffset` 因使用绝对 `bIdx` 计算偏移而导致的越界写入问题。当部分 batch 的序列长度 S1=0 时，有效 batch 的 lseOffset 会错误地写入越界位置，导致对应 LSE 输出保留预填的 `inf`（3e+99）。修复方案是在 `FlashDecodeCompute` 中新增 `lseBatchOffset` 变量，在 TND/NTD 布局下基于 `actualSeqQlenAddr[bIdx-1]` 计算累积 S1 偏移，并传递给 `CombineSplitKVRes` 替代原有的 `bIdx`；非 TND 布局下 `lseBatchOffset` 等于 `bIdx`，行为不变。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **新增 `lseBatchOffset` 变量并计算累积偏移**：在 `FlashDecodeCompute` 中新增 `uint64_t lseBatchOffset = (uint64_t)bIdx`，并在 TND/NTD 布局分支内通过 `actualSeqQlenAddr[bIdx - 1]` 赋值为累积 S1 偏移，与 `attenOutOffset` 的 TND 处理逻辑保持一致。\n- **`CombineSplitKVRes` 签名新增 `lseBatchOffset` 参数**：方法声明和定义均增加 `uint64_t lseBatchOffset` 形参，替换原先直接使用 `bIdx` 计算 LSE 偏移的方式。\n- **两处 `lseOffset` 计算公式改用 `lseBatchOffset`**：在 `CombineSplitKVRes` 的主循环和尾部处理中，将 `(bIdx * constInfo.n2Size + n2Idx)` 替换为 `(lseBatchOffset * constInfo.n2Size + n2Idx)`，确保 LSE 输出写入位置与累积 batch 偏移对齐。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-08T22:32:54+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-08T22:34:06+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":179161960,"discussion_id":"113e9d6aff90685e9b6e549323adbce2cf2d5177","body":"## CLA Signature Pass  \n huang-chuhong, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-07-08T22:33:01+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-08T22:33:01+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode